resources.string:
These %1$d track(s) will be removed from the library (marked "removed from library"):
· Audio files are not deleted;
· Favorites, play stats and playlist entries are hidden from the library view but kept;
· A rescan will not bring them back until you restore them under About & diagnostics → Restore songs removed from library.

Before confirming, check that the "Keep" track in each group is the one you want.
